# A cost to attack is not a requirement (CR 508.1d), but the requirement still holds where an attack costs nothing: Ghostly
# Prison taxes only attacks on its controller, not on a planeswalker they control (the rulings). With Bot2's Ghostly Prison
# and Liliana of the Veil out, Anje's Ravager (attacks each combat if able) must attack Liliana: a declaration of no
# attackers is refused on turn 3, and the Ravager attacks Liliana for nothing. Liliana, at 3 loyalty, takes 3 and dies;
# Bot2 stays at 20; Mox Ruby, which could have paid, stays untapped.

